# The viewer over a chat's two pictures (alice's other device sends them: peer createfiles): the first grows from its
# thumbnail; ›, the next (imageNear); a swipe back to the first; marking: a box drawn, its note said, 下载标注后的图片,
# then 添加到对话: the marked picture and the note's quote in the composer, sent with words.
#env MBUI_VIEWER_AWAKE=1
timeout 60000
until 端到端测试
log do: peer createfiles 两张图片 {T} post:收到两张图片 {T} -- e2e-photo.jpg e2e-photo2.png
timeout 180000
until 两张图片 {T}
timeout 60000
wait 1000
tap 两张图片 {T}
until =studio
timeout 120000
until img:e2e-photo.jpg
timeout 60000
wait 1000
tap img:e2e-photo.jpg
wait 120
shot 1-flying
until %
wait 1500
shot 2-open
until icon:chevron-right
tap icon:chevron-right
until e2e-photo2.png
wait 800
shot 3-next
drag 60 400 300 0 300
until e2e-photo.jpg
wait 800
shot 4-swiped-back
tap icon:edit
until icon:scribble
drag 120 360 140 90 300
until =完成
type 这里要对齐 {T}
tap =完成
gone =完成
shot 5-marked
tap icon:download
until 已保存到「下载」
tap 添加到对话
until 已添加到对话
gone 添加到对话
until 发消息
wait 1500
shot 6-draft
timeout 120000
tap 发消息
type 标注过的图片 {T}
wait 2000
tap icon:arrow-up
empty
until 标注过的图片 {T}
gone 正在发送
shot 7-sent
